# These TSVs are byte-exact reference dumps: their sha256 IS the assertion the
# NAV determinism gate makes, so end-of-line conversion must never touch them.
# The repo has core.autocrlf=true, which would otherwise hand a fresh checkout
# CRLF copies whose digests match nothing in the README beside them -- and the
# failure would look like a determinism regression rather than a checkout
# artefact. `-text` stores and restores these files verbatim.
*.tsv -text
